# Cloudflare Pages clean URL rewrites
# These let the iOS app's hardcoded URLs (gcseboss.com/privacy-policy etc.) serve the right content
# Status 200 = rewrite (URL stays clean in browser, server responds with the .html content)

/privacy-policy     /privacy-policy.html     200
/terms-of-service   /terms-of-service.html   200
/contact            /contact.html            200
/blog               /blog/index.html         200
/blog/welcome-to-gcse-boss  /blog/posts/welcome-to-gcse-boss.html  200
